7832:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPRESCALER_DIV1: ETRP Prescaler OFF.
7833:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPRESCALER_DIV2: ETRP frequency divided by 2.
