7838:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPOLARITY_INVERTED: active low or falling edge active.
7839:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPOLARITY_NONINVERTED: active high or rising edge active.
